<p>I fixed the title for you. Next time do it yourself.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-1226 may be safely observed remotely or piecemeal, its anomalous properties manifest only when it is viewed in person and in its entirety</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Comma -&gt; semicolon</p>
<blockquote>
<p>A 6&#160;cm x 6&#160;cm<br />
two meters by eight meters</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Please be consistent with your numbering. This is a personal button of mine, though.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>It depicts, in great detail, an atomic missile strike on a large city1. The quality of the brushwork is extraordinarily high; individual brushstrokes are visible only under very high magnification. Photorealistic attention has been paid to every detail of the painting, from optically correct reflections on the 11,121 glass shards depicted, to the accurate representation of the effects of atomic firestorm on the 3,129 human figures portrayed on the streets.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>WE GET IT, IT'S VERY DETAILED. You didn't need to write 'its really detailed' so many times. It's just redundant.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Addendum XXXX-01</p>
</blockquote>
<p>What is this.</p>
<blockquote>
